{"id":"n61510-1-11","stage":1,"title":"매우 · 非常","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61510-1-11-1","ko":"지난 달 매출이 매우 많이 올랐더군. 수고가 많았네.","zh":"上个月的销售额涨了很多呢，大家辛苦了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난","meaning":"过， 度过","explanation":"지나다：过， 度过；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"4","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매출이","meaning":"销售","explanation":"매출：销售；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"매출","audio":"/audio/ecf51b1f43cc5e6be7f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55743","senseId":"1","lemma":"매출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올랐더군.","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더군：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수고가","meaning":"辛苦，受累","explanation":"수고：辛苦，受累；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수고","audio":"/audio/5fbed1b5bed3090038f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15619","senseId":"1","lemma":"수고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많았네.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过， 度过","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"超过某个时期或限度。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"ecf51b1f43cc5e6b","term":"매출","zh":"销售","audio":"/audio/ecf51b1f43cc5e6be7f9.mp3","entryId":"55743","definition":"出售东西。","pronunciation":["매ː출"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]},{"id":"5fbed1b5bed30900","term":"수고","zh":"辛苦，受累","audio":"/audio/5fbed1b5bed3090038f8.mp3","entryId":"15619","definition":"因做某事而出力、费心；或指那样的困难。","pronunciation":["수ː고"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4534bbb3e8dfac036e8b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61510-1-11-2","ko":"감사합니다, 부장님.","zh":"谢谢您，部长。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"감사합니다,","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"감사하다：感谢，感激；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"감사하다","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71728","senseId":"1","lemma":"감사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부장님.","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"552d49e405b9383e","term":"감사하다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3","entryId":"71728","definition":"觉得感恩。","pronunciation":["감ː사하다"]},{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf84183a22f1873bcf3e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61510","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.333,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["谢谢您，部长。","上个月的销售额涨了很多呢，大家辛苦了。","奶奶，这条手帕上绣的花是什么呀？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["上个月的销售额涨了很多呢，大家辛苦了。","奶奶，这条手帕上绣的花是什么呀？","谢谢您，部长。"],"answer":2}]}
